1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,400
Good morning, everyone.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
<i>The old poet walks into the garden.</i>

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,400
Where is my book?
I left it on the table.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
{\an8}Rome, many years ago.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,400
The girl sings a song for her mother.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
- Are you ready?
- Yes, I am ready.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,400
The boy carries water from the well.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,400
<i>Listen to the wind in the trees.</i>

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,400
We read one page every day.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,400
The teacher writes a word on the wall.

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,400
Why are you laughing?

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,400
Because the dog is wearing my hat.

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,400
The farmer loves his fields
and his small house.

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,400
<i>I remember the sea.</i>

15
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,400
Bring me the bread, please.

16
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,400
The children run to the river.

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,400
A letter arrived this morning.

18
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,400
Who wrote it?

19
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,400
My friend from the city.

20
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,400
<i>She waits by the door
until the sun goes down.</i>

21
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,400
The soldiers are tired.

22
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,400
They want to go home.

23
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,400
Open the window, it is hot.

24
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,400
The cat sleeps on the warm stone.

25
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,400
Tomorrow we will see the queen.

26
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,400
I do not know the answer.

27
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,400
Ask the poet. He knows everything.

28
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,400
<i>The stars are bright tonight.</i>

29
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,400
Thank you for the beautiful day.

30
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,400
Goodbye, my friends.
